<p style="text-align: left;"><b>THE SITE AND ALL PR NEWSWIRE MATERIALS ARE MADE AVAILABLE ON AN &quot;AS IS&quot; AND &quot;AS AVAILABLE&quot; BASIS, WITHOUT ANY REPRESENTATION, PROMISE OR WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED.&nbsp; TO THE FULLEST EXTENT PERMISSIBLE PURSUANT TO APPLICABLE LAW, PR NEWSWIRE, ITS OFFICERS, DIRECTORS, EMPLOYEES, PARENTS, SUBSIDIARIES, AFFILIATES, SUPPLIERS, ADVERTISERS, AND AGENTS (THE “PR NEWSWIRE PARTIES”) DISCLAIM ALL WARRANTIES, EXPRESS, IMPLIED OR STATUTORY, INCLUDING WARRANTIES (I) WARRANTIES OF TITLE AND NON-INFRINGEMENT, (II) WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY AND FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE OR USE, (III) WARRANTIES RELATING TO THE ADEQUACY, ACCURACY, TIMELINESS, QUALITY, SAFETY OR COMPLETENESS OF ANY INFORMATION OR CONTENT AVAILABLE THROUGH THE SITE, (IV) WARRANTIES THAT THE SITE WILL BE AVAILABLE FOR USE, UNINTERRUPTED, ERROR FREE OR SECURE, OR THAT ALL FEATURES, FUNCTIONS OR OPERATIONS OF THE SITE WILL BE AVAILABLE OR PERFORM AS DESCRIBED OR THAT ANY ERRORS WILL BE CORRECTED, (V) WARRANTIES THAT THE SITE (INCLUDING FILES AVAILABLE FOR DOWNLOAD FROM OR THROUGH THE SITE) OR THE SERVER(S) ON WHICH THE SITE IS HOSTED ARE FREE OF VIRUSES OR OTHER HARMFUL COMPONENTS. &nbsp;NO OPINION, ADVICE, OR STATEMENT OF PR NEWSWIRE OR ITS AFFILIATES, SUPPLIERS, AGENTS, CUSTOMERS, OR USERS, WHETHER MADE IN THESE TOU, ON THE SITE OR OTHERWISE, SHALL CREATE ANY WARRANTY.</b></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><b>YOUR USE OF THE SITE AND ANY AND ALL INFORMATION OR CONTENT THAT YOU VIEW, DOWNLOAD OR OTHERWISE OBTAIN FROM OR THROUGH THE SITE IS AT YOUR OWN RISK.&nbsp; UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES SHALL PR NEWSWIRE OR THE PR NEWSWIRE PARTIES BE LIABLE TO YOU FOR ANY LOSS, DAMAGE OR EXPENSE INCURRED IN CONNECTION WITH YOUR USE OF OR INABILITY TO USE THE SITE OR YOUR USE OF OR RELIANCE ON ANY INFORMATION OR CONTENT THAT YOU VIEW, DOWNLOAD OR OTHERWISE OBTAIN FROM OR THROUGH THE SITE</b></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><b>UNDER NO CIRCUMSTANCES SHALL PR NEWSWIRE OR THE PR NEWSWIRE PARTIES BE LIABLE TO YOU FOR ANY LOSS, DAMAGE OR EXPENSE INCURRED IN CONNECTION WITH ANY MISREPRESENTATION OR OTHER BREACH OF THESE TOU BY ANOTHER USER, OR ANY COMMUNICATION, ACTIVITY, BUSINESS DEALING OR TRANSACTION BETWEEN YOU AND ANY OTHER THIRD PARTY</b></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><b>THE PR NEWSWIRE PARTIES SHALL HAVE NO LIABILITY FOR, AND YOU AGREE TO WAIVE ANY AND ALL RIGHTS AGAINST THE PR NEWSWIRE PARTIES AND HOLD THE PR NEWSWIRE PARTIES HARMLESS IN CONNECTION WITH, ANY CLAIMS RELATING TO (I) ANY ACTION TAKEN OR NOT TAKEN BY THE PR NEWSWIRE PARTIES AS PART OF AN INVESTIGATION OF A SUSPECTED VIOLATION OF THESE TOU, AND (II) ANY STEPS TAKEN OR NOT TAKEN BY THE PR NEWSWIRE PARTIES IN RESPONSE A CONCLUSION THAT A VIOLATION OF THE TOU HAS OCCURRED OR NOT OCCURRED.</b></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><b>REGARDLESS OF THE FORM OF ACTION,&nbsp;WHETHER TORT, BREACH OF CONTRACT, BREACH OF WARRANTY, STRICT LIABILITY, OR OTHERWISE,&nbsp;IN NO EVENT SHALL THE PR NEWSWIRE PARTIES BE LIABLE TO YOU&nbsp;FOR ANY INDIRECT, CONSEQUENTIAL, EXEMPLARY, INCIDENTAL OR PUNITIVE DAMAGE OR EXPENSE, INCLUDING LOSS OF BUSINESS, LOST PROFITS OR OTHER ECONOMIC DAMAGE&nbsp;OF ANY KIND ARISING FROM OR RELATED TO YOUR USE OF (OR YOUR INABILITY TO USE) THE SITE OR ANY PR NEWSWIRE MATERIALS, OR ARISING FROM ANY OTHER CAUSE, EVEN IF THE PR NEWSWIRE PARTIES HAVE BEEN ADVISED OF THE POSSIBILITY OR FORESEEABILITY OF SUCH DAMAGE OR EXPENSE.&nbsp;..</b></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p id="info17">&nbsp;</p>
<h3 style="text-align: left;"><b><a></a>Limitation of Liability</b></h3>
<p style="text-align: left;"><b>THE PR NEWSWIRE PARTIES’ TOTAL CUMULATIVE LIABILITY TO YOU ON ACCOUNT OF ANY AND ALL CLAIMS AND ACTIONS OF ALL KINDS, INCLUDING TORT, CONTRACT, STRICT LIABILITY, BREACH OF CONTRACT OR BREACH OF WARRANTY&nbsp;ARISING IN CONNECTION WITH YOUR USE OF (OR INABILITY TO USE) THE SITEOR ANY PR NEWSWIRE MATERIALS, OR ARISING FROM ALL OTHER CAUSES,&nbsp;SHALL NEVER&nbsp;EXCEED THE GREATER OF THE TOTAL AMOUNT PAID TO THE PR NEWSWIRE PARTIES BY YOU, IF ANY, FOR ACCESS TO THE SITE IN THE CURRENT CALENDAR YEAR AND ONE HUNDRED DOLLARS ($100.00).</b></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><b>NOTWITHSTANDING THE FOREGOING DISCLAIMERS AND LIMITATIONS OF LIABILITY, NOTHING IN THESE TOU EXCLUDES OR LIMITS THE PR&nbsp;NEWSWIRE PARTIES’ LIABILITY FOR ANY CLAIM THAT, BY LAW, CANNOT BE EXCLUDED OR LIMITED</b></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p id="info18">&nbsp;</p>
<h3 style="text-align: left;"><b><a id="S"></a>Copyright Infringement</b></h3>
<p style="text-align: left;">The Digital Millennium Copyright Act of 1998 (the &quot;DMCA&quot;) provides recourse for copyright owners who believe that material appearing on the internet infringes their rights under U.S. copyright law. &nbsp;See http://loc.gov/copyright/ for the most current statutory requirements.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">If you believe, in good faith, that any materials posted on the Site infringe your copyright, please contact us promptly so that we may take appropriate action.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">In order for us to respond to your claim of infringement, you (or your agent) must provide us, in writing, with the following information</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">an electronic or physical signature of the person authorized to act on behalf of the owner of the copyright;</p>
<ul>
<li style="text-align: left;">a description of the copyrighted work that you believe has been infringed;</li>
<li style="text-align: left;">a description of where the infringing material is located or identified on the Site;</li>
<li style="text-align: left;">your name, address, telephone number, and e-mail address;</li>
<li style="text-align: left;">a statement by you that you have a good-faith belief that the allegedly infringing use is not authorized by the copyright owner of the allegedly infringed work, an agent of the owner, or the law; and</li>
<li style="text-align: left;">a statement by you, made under penalty of perjury, that the information submitted to us is accurate and that you are the owner of the copyright in the allegedly infringed work, or authorized to act on the owner's behalf.</li>
</ul>
<p style="text-align: left;">The above information should be provided to PR Newswire's agent for notice of claims of copyright infringement, who can be reached by clicking&nbsp;<a href="https://www.prnewswire.com/contact-us/copyright-infringment-notification.html">here</a>&nbsp;or sending the requested information as follows</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><u>By mail</u></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Copyright Agent</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Legal Department</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">PR Newswire Association LLC</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">200 Vesey Street, 19th floor</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">New York, NY 10281</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><u>By fax<br>
</u></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">212-489-9054</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">Please note that you will be liable for damages (including attorneys' fees and costs) if you materially misrepresent the nature of your rights or the nature of the alleged infringement.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">It is PR Newswire’s policy to terminate the user accounts of repeat infringers or otherwise take reasonable steps to prevent such users from continuing to post</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p id="info19">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><b><a></a>Miscellaneous</b></p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><u>General</u>.&nbsp; This Site is created, controlled and operated by PR Newswire in the United States, and is intended for use by residents of the United States, its territories and possessions who are at least 18 years of age or older.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><u>Amendment</u>.&nbsp; Any amendment to these TOU offered by you must be in writing and signed by PR Newswire.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><u>Notice</u>.&nbsp; We may be required by state or federal law to notify you of certain events.&nbsp; You hereby acknowledge and consent that such notices will be effective upon our posting them on the Site or delivering them to you through e-mail.&nbsp; You have the right to request that we provide such notices to you in hard copy, and may do so by contacting us at PR Newswire, 200 Vesey Street, New York, New York 10281, Attn: General Counsel.&nbsp; If you are a California resident, you may have notices e-mailed to you by sending a letter to the foregoing address with your e-mail address and a request that notices be e-mailed. &nbsp;If you do not provide us with accurate information and update it, as necessary, we cannot be held liable for a resulting failure to notify you.&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><u>Cumulative Rights</u>.&nbsp; Except as otherwise provided herein, no rights or remedies of PR Newswire in these TOU are exclusive, but are cumulative of all other rights and remedies.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><u>Assignment</u>.&nbsp; The rights and obligation of PR Newswire under these TOU may be assigned or delegated, in whole or in part, by PR Newswire to an affiliate or a third party in connection with a merger, acquisition, reorganization, or sale of assets.&nbsp; You may not assign or delegate these TOU, in whole or in part, and any attempt to do so will be null and void.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><u>Choice of Law &amp; Forum</u>. &nbsp;The formation, construction and interpretation of these TOU and all disputes arising out of or relating hereto shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of New York, giving no effect to conflict of law principals.&nbsp; The U.N. Convention on Contracts for the International Sale of Goods is expressly excluded from any interpretation of these TOU.&nbsp; Any dispute relating to these TOU shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the state and federal courts in New York, New York, U.S.A.&nbsp; The parties agree to submit to the personal and exclusive jurisdiction of these courts, and to waive any objections to jurisdiction, venue or forum.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><u>Construction</u>.&nbsp; In these TOU, unless otherwise specified: (i) &quot;herein,&quot; hereof,&quot; &quot;hereunder,&quot; &quot;hereto,&quot; and similar terms, refer to these TOU as a whole and not merely to the specific section, paragraph or clause in which the respective word appears; (ii) any defined terms may, unless the context otherwise requires, be used in the singular or the plural; (iii) “or” connotes any combination of all or any of the items listed; and (iv) where “including,” “include” or “includes” is used to refer to an example or begins a list of items, such example or list shall not be exclusive..:</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><u>No Third Party Beneficiaries</u>.&nbsp; Except for PR Newswire’s affiliates, and the suppliers and vendors that support the Site, there are no third party beneficiaries of these TOU.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><u>Headings</u>.&nbsp; Headings and captions contained in these TOU are included for convenience only, and are not intended to define or govern the interpretation of any section or provision hereof.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><u>Waiver</u>.&nbsp;&nbsp; The failure of PR Newswire to exercise or enforce any right or provision of these TOU shall not constitute a waiver of such right or provision, and no waiver by PR Newswire of a breach or default hereunder shall be deemed to be a waiver of any preceding or subsequent breach or default.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><u>Severability of Terms</u>.&nbsp; If any provision of these TOU is found by a court of competent jurisdiction to be invalid, illegal or otherwise unenforceable, such provision shall be deemed deleted from the TOU and replaced with a provision that approximates, as nearly as possible, the intent of the offending provision while remaining valid, legal and enforceable.&nbsp; All other provisions of these TOU shall remain in full force and effect</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><b>Contact Us</b></p>
<p style="text-align: left;">If you encounter any problems with or have any questions about the Site, PR Newswire Materials, or these TOU, you may contact us via&nbsp;<a href="https://www.prnewswire.com/website-feedback-tc.html/">this form</a>.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">For legal notices, please contact us in writing at 200 Vesey Street, New York, New York 10281, Attn: General Counsel.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">California residents may also choose to contact the Complaint Assistance Unit of the Division of Consumer Sites of the Department of Consumer Affairs, at 400 R Street, Sacramento, California 95814 or (800) 952-5210.</p>
<p style="text-align: left;">&nbsp;</p>
<p style="text-align: left;"><b>Copyright Notice</b>.</p>
